- `for t in __JOB_NAME__ __REPO_URL__ __REF__ __TAG__ __DOCKERFILE__ __IMAGE__ __PUSH__ __PUSH_SECRET__ __DEADLINE_SECONDS__ __SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH__; do grep -q "$t" hack/build-job.yaml || exit 1; done`
